THE DATA IN THIS REPOSITORY IS NOT COVERED BY THE LICENSE ABOVE.

oulad-bbb/          Open University Learning Analytics Dataset (OULAD)
                    CC BY 4.0  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
                    Kuzilek, J., Hlosta, M., & Zdrahal, Z. (2017). Open University
                    Learning Analytics dataset. Scientific Data, 4, 170171.
                    https://doi.org/10.1038/sdata.2017.171

persuade-4prompts/  PERSUADE 2.0 corpus
                    CC BY-NC-SA 4.0  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/
                    NON-COMMERCIAL USE ONLY. Derivatives must carry the same license.
                    Crossley, S. A., Baffour, P., Tian, Y., Franklin, A., Benner, M.,
                    & Boser, U. (2024). A large-scale corpus for assessing written
                    argumentation: PERSUADE 2.0. Assessing Writing, 61.

uci-student-performance/   UCI Student Performance (secondary schools, Portugal)
                    CC BY 4.0  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
                    Cortez, P., & Silva, A. (2008). Using data mining to predict
                    secondary school student performance. In A. Brito & J. Teixeira
                    (Eds.), Proceedings of 5th Future Business Technology Conference
                    (pp. 5-12). Donated to the UCI Machine Learning Repository, 2014.
                    https://doi.org/10.24432/C5TG7T

justhink/           JUSThink Dialogue and Actions Corpus, and the PE-HRI companions
                    CC BY 4.0  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
                    Norman, U., Dinkar, T., Nasir, J., Bruno, B., Clavel, C., &
                    Dillenbourg, P. (2021). JUSThink Dialogue and Actions Corpus
                    (v1.0.0). Zenodo. https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.4627104
                    Nasir, J., Norman, U., Bruno, B., Chetouani, M., & Dillenbourg, P.
                    (2021). PE-HRI: A multimodal dataset for the study of productive
                    engagement in a robot mediated collaborative educational setting.
                    Zenodo. https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.4633092
                    Nasir, J., Bruno, B., & Dillenbourg, P. (2024). PE-HRI-temporal.
                    Zenodo. https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.13834073

ednet-kt3-500/      EdNet KT3, a 500-user extract of the public mirror
                    CC BY-NC 4.0  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/
                    NON-COMMERCIAL USE ONLY.
                    Choi, Y., Lee, Y., Shin, D., Cho, J., Park, S., Lee, S., Baek, J.,
                    Bae, C., Kim, B., & Heo, J. (2020). EdNet: A large-scale hierarchical
                    dataset in education. In Artificial Intelligence in Education
                    (pp. 69-73). Springer. Data released by Riiid AI Research.

collab-chat/        Online collaborative learning in a computer networks course
                    CC BY 4.0  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
                    Villa-Torrano, C. (2021). Dataset on an online collaborative
                    learning situation in a computer networks course. Zenodo.
                    https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.5150537

fieldday-aqualab/   Open Game Data, AQUALAB
fieldday-waves/     Open Game Data, WAVES
                    CC0 1.0 Universal, public domain dedication.
                    https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
                    Field Day Lab, University of Wisconsin-Madison.
                    https://opengamedata.fielddaylab.wisc.edu

canvas-network/     Canvas Network Person-Course, January 2014 to September 2015
                    CC BY 4.0  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
                    Canvas Network (2016). Canvas Network person-course (1/2014 to
                    9/2015) de-identified open dataset. Harvard Dataverse.
                    https://doi.org/10.7910/DVN/1XORAL

